OL,3,GNEWSAInitial plans for up to 500 homes
OL,4,Aon town edge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA housing developer has signalled its
OL,7,Fintent to build up to 500 homes on the
OL,8,Fedge of Wigston.
OL,10,FDavid Wilson Homes has submitted
OL,11,Fdocuments to Oadby and Wigston Borough
OL,12,FCouncil asking whether an environmental
OL,13,Fimpact assessment (EIA) is required as
OL,14,Fpart of a planning application for a
OL,15,Fhousing development on land off Cooks
OL,16,FLane.
OL,18,FAn EIA sets out the likely
OL,19,Fenvironmental impacts of a project and
OL,20,Fhow they can be mitigated.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
