OL,3,GNEWSAInitial plans for up to 500 homes
OL,4,Aon town edge
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn documents submitted to the council,
OL,7,Fthe developer said the proposed housing
OL,8,Fscheme - named Wigston Meadows Phase 3
OL,9,F- would incorporate "significant open
OL,10,Fspace".
